ang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョ・コ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よ（る）</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">根拠</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こんきょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">根据</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">証拠</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうこ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">证据</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">衰</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>衰</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">スイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おとろ（える）</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">衰える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おとろえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">衰弱；衰退（动词）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">衰退</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すいたい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">衰退（名词）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">懸</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>悬</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケン・ケ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">か（ける）</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">懸念</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けねん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">担忧</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">懸命</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けんめい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">拼命</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">兆</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>兆；征兆</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">きざ（し）</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">兆し</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きざし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">征兆；苗头</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">前兆</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぜんちょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">前兆</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">妥</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>妥</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ダ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">—</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">妥協</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">だきょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">妥协</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">妥当</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">だとう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">妥当</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">弊</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>弊</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヘイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">—</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">弊害</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">へいがい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">弊病；危害</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">弊社</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">へいしゃ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">敝公司</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">踏</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>踏</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">トウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふ（む）</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">踏まえる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふまえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">根据；立足于</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">踏襲</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とうしゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">沿袭</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">携</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>携</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たずさ（わる）</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">携帯</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいたい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">携带；手机</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">提携</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ていけい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">合作</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">覆</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>覆</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おお（う）・くつがえ（す）</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">覆う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おおう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">覆盖</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">覆面</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふくめん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">蒙面</span></li></ul></