ss=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">めんじょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">免除</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">遂</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>遂</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">スイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">と（げる）</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">遂行</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すいこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">执行；完成</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">未遂</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">みすい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">未遂</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">阻</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>阻</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">はば（む）</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">阻止</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">阻止</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">阻害</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そがい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">阻碍</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">還</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>还</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">—</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">還元</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんげん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">回